{"id":"73130ab4ebcdfb39","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-disjoint-union.md","title":"项重写系统的不交并","display":"df-disjoint-union — 项重写系统的不交并","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-disjoint-union","aliases":["56-df-disjoint-union"],"display":"df-disjoint-union — 项重写系统的不交并","depends_on":["[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","[[56-df-signature-relative-rewrite]]"],"source_section":"§5.7.1 Definition 5.7.1","source_printed_pages":"163–164","source_ocr_blocks":[184,185],"source_verification":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-disjoint-union"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-disjoint-union</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-disjoint-union — 项重写系统的不交并"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d7d212169855cb94\" href=\"?note=d7d212169855cb94\" title=\"56-df-signature-relative-rewrite\">56-df-signature-relative-rewrite</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.7.1 Definition 5.7.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"163–164"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>184</span><span>185</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，给定签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_i=(F_i,a_i)\">\\(\\Sigma_i=(F_i,a_i)\\)</span> 和规则集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_i\">\\(R_i\\)</span>。假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_0\\cap F_1=\\varnothing\">\\(F_0\\cap F_1=\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 是与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_0\\cup F_1\">\\(F_0\\cup F_1\\)</span> 不交的可数无限变量集，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma_i,V,R_i)\">\\(\\forall i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma_i,V,R_i)\\)</span>；TRS谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a>。以下带下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 的式子均对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Red}\">\\(\\operatorname{Red}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d7d212169855cb94\" href=\"?note=d7d212169855cb94\" title=\"56-df-signature-relative-rewrite\">56-df-signature-relative-rewrite</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigSum}(\\Sigma_0,\\Sigma_1)\\coloneqq(F_0\\cup F_1,a_0\\cup a_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SigSum}(\\Sigma_0,\\Sigma_1)\\coloneqq(F_0\\cup F_1,a_0\\cup a_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sum}((\\Sigma_0,R_0),(\\Sigma_1,R_1))\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{SigSum}(\\Sigma_0,\\Sigma_1),R_0\\cup R_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sum}((\\Sigma_0,R_0),(\\Sigma_1,R_1))\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{SigSum}(\\Sigma_0,\\Sigma_1),R_0\\cup R_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\operatorname{SigSum}(\\Sigma_0,\\Sigma_1),\\quad R\\coloneqq R_0\\cup R_1,\\quad T\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V),\\quad T_i\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_i,V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\operatorname{SigSum}(\\Sigma_0,\\Sigma_1),\\quad R\\coloneqq R_0\\cup R_1,\\quad T\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V),\\quad T_i\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_i,V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to_i\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma_i,V,R_i),\\quad\\to\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma,V,R),\\quad\\to_{i\\mid\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma,V,R_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to_i\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma_i,V,R_i),\\quad\\to\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma,V,R),\\quad\\to_{i\\mid\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma,V,R_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to=\\to_{0\\mid\\Sigma}\\cup\\to_{1\\mid\\Sigma}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to=\\to_{0\\mid\\Sigma}\\cup\\to_{1\\mid\\Sigma}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>函数符号集不交保证元数函数的并仍为函数，规则合法性在签名扩张下保持。最后等式按所用规则属于哪一分量直接得到。两个分量共用变量全集；变量不带黑白颜色。→ᵢ 的替换值域为 Tᵢ，→ᵢ∣Σ 的替换值域为混合项集 T，两者不能混淆。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的 Terese (2003) 本地 DjVu，当前文字层已重新解码并核对一致。OCR 页块序号不等于 DjVu 物理页码；未取得 PDF 页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-signature-relative-rewrite","status":"resolved","id":"d7d212169855cb94","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-signature-relative-rewrite]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"对每个 $i\\in\\{0,1\\}$，给定签名 $\\Sigma_i=(F_i,a_i)$ 和规则集 $R_i$。假定 $F_0\\cap F_1=\\varnothing$，$V$ 是与 $F_0\\cup F_1$ 不交的可数无限变量集，且 $\\forall i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma_i,V,R_i)$；TRS谓词见 [[56-df-rewrite-system]]。以下带下标 $i$ 的式子均对 $i\\in\\{0,1\\}$ 定义。$\\operatorname{Red}$ 见 [[56-df-signature-relative-rewrite]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-signature-relative-rewrite","status":"resolved","id":"d7d212169855cb94","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"对每个 $i\\in\\{0,1\\}$，给定签名 $\\Sigma_i=(F_i,a_i)$ 和规则集 $R_i$。假定 $F_0\\cap F_1=\\varnothing$，$V$ 是与 $F_0\\cup F_1$ 不交的可数无限变量集，且 $\\forall i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma_i,V,R_i)$；TRS谓词见 [[56-df-rewrite-system]]。以下带下标 $i$ 的式子均对 $i\\in\\{0,1\\}$ 定义。$\\operatorname{Red}$ 见 [[56-df-signature-relative-rewrite]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"i\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_i=(F_i,a_i)","display":false},{"tex":"R_i","display":false},{"tex":"F_0\\cap F_1=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"F_0\\cup F_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma_i,V,R_i)","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Red}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigSum}(\\Sigma_0,\\Sigma_1)\\coloneqq(F_0\\cup F_1,a_0\\cup a_1).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sum}((\\Sigma_0,R_0),(\\Sigma_1,R_1))\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{SigSum}(\\Sigma_0,\\Sigma_1),R_0\\cup R_1).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\operatorname{SigSum}(\\Sigma_0,\\Sigma_1),\\quad R\\coloneqq R_0\\cup R_1,\\quad T\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V),\\quad T_i\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_i,V).","display":true},{"tex":"\\to_i\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma_i,V,R_i),\\quad\\to\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma,V,R),\\quad\\to_{i\\mid\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma,V,R_i).","display":true},{"tex":"\\to=\\to_{0\\mid\\Sigma}\\cup\\to_{1\\mid\\Sigma}.","display":true}],"bytes":2053,"backlinks":[{"id":"e9431b6b9d55e1b2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$U\\ne\\varnothing$ 是函数符号集合，$a:U\\to\\mathbb N$，$V$ 是与 $U$ 不交的可数无限变量集。$P$ 为集合参数；$\\operatorname{Rule}$、$\\operatorname{Sum}$ 沿用 [[56-df-disjoint-union]]。$a\\upharpoonright F$ 表示通常函数限制。"},{"id":"01802560a40eec95","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-disjoint-union]] 的不交签名 $\\Sigma_i=(F_i,a_i)$、并签名 $\\Sigma$、变量集 $V$ 和项集 $T$。位置、前缀序、子项与 $\\operatorname{root}$ 见 [[56-df-position]]、[[56-df-subterm]]。$x\\in V$，$f\\in F_0\\cup F_1$，$k=(a_0\\cup a_1)(f)$，$t_1,\\ldots,t_k\\in T$，$i\\in\\{0,1\\}$。"},{"id":"69109041e60f84f6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf F,\\mathsf{or},\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1$ 为四个互异函数符号，$V$ 是与它们不交的可数无限变量集，$x,y\\in V$ 且 $x\\ne y$。$\\operatorname{Red}$、$\\operatorname{SigSum}$ 见 [[56-df-disjoint-union]]，$\\mathrm{Terminating}$ 见 [[56-df-terminating]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-335","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-disjoint-union.md]]"},{"id":"aaaf35b38089bd17","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-disjoint-union]] 的 $\\Sigma_i,R_i,V,T_i,\\to_i$ 及并系统 $\\Sigma,R,T,\\to$；两个函数符号集不交，原分量和混合项的关系分别在各自签名中计算。 $\\mathrm{Confluent}$ 见 [[56-df-confluent]]。"},{"id":"0a047c291d67a9f2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-disjoint-union]] 的 $\\Sigma_i,R_i,V,T_i,\\to_i$ 及并系统 $\\Sigma,R,T,\\to$；两个函数符号集不交，原分量和混合项的关系分别在各自签名中计算。 $\\mathrm{Terminating}$ 见 [[56-df-terminating]]；$\\operatorname{Collapsing}$、$\\operatorname{Duplicating}$ 见 [[56-df-collapsing-duplicating]]。以下 $C_i,D_i$ 为局部命题缩写。"},{"id":"57919581a5b556fd","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-disjoint-union]] 的 $\\Sigma_i,R_i,V,T_i,\\to_i$ 及并系统 $\\Sigma,R,T,\\to$；两个函数符号集不交，原分量和混合项的关系分别在各自签名中计算。 $\\mathrm{Convergent}$、$\\mathrm{NF}$ 见 [[56-df-convergent]]、[[56-df-normal-form]]；终止蕴含弱正规化见 [[56-thm-sn-implies-wn]]，两项模块定理见 [[56-thm-disjoint-union-confluence]]、[[56-thm-disjoint-union-weak-normalization]]。$\\to^*$ 为已绑定关系的自反传递闭包。"},{"id":"3374832c41169108","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-disjoint-union]] 的 $\\Sigma_i,R_i,V,T_i,\\to_i$ 及并系统 $\\Sigma,R,T,\\to$；两个函数符号集不交，原分量和混合项的关系分别在各自签名中计算。 $\\mathrm{WN}$ 见 [[56-df-weakly-normalizing]]，层数见 [[56-df-modular-term-rank]]。"}],"outgoing":["a6c29a8d098ef0ed","d7d212169855cb94"]}